  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/event/41582#2026-09-24T20:00:00-04:00",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/additionalType": [
      {
        "@id": "http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/MusicEvent"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-09-24T20:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-09-24T22:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Céleste Lévis Si elle"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Céleste Lévis is releasing her fifth album, Si elle, in winter 2026, and with it, she’s returning to the stage with a full band to round out her sound. Long lauded for her delicate ballads, Lévis makes a bold foray in her newest album into fully realized modern pop rock, proof of how she’s stepped into her own as an artist. The story-telling on the album reflects her personal journey as a woman navigating the music industry, as a singer-songwriter rewriting her identity and as a young mom discovering newfound strength in herself. In the works since 2021, this album is a testament to the deep transformation Lévis has undergone in her personal life, music career and on-stage performances. Her live shows are kinetic, her arrangements and harmonies rich and her voice is more free than ever before. She delivers a vibrant, heartfelt performance that feels like a breath of fresh air."
      },
      {
        "@value": "Avec Si elle, son cinquième album à paraître à l’hiver 2026, Céleste Lévis revient sur scène avec un spectacle en formule full band qui dévoile toutes les dimensions de sa musique. Longtemps associée à la douceur des balades, elle propose ici une œuvre pop/rock audacieuse, enracinée, actuelle et à l’image d’une artiste qui prend pleinement sa place. Si elle raconte un cheminement. Celui d’une femme dans l’industrie musicale, d’une autrice-compositrice qui se redéfinit, d’une jeune mère qui trouve une nouvelle force. Pensé et peaufiné depuis 2021, cet album marque une transformation profonde, personnelle, musicale, et scénique. Sur scène, l’énergie est palpable, les arrangements et les harmonies sont riches, la voix est plus libre que jamais. Un spectacle vibrant, sincère, et porteur d’un souffle nouveau."
      }
    ],
