        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-10-10T22:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "summersets"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "summersets is the new duo from Juno and Polaris-nominated singer-songwriter Kalle Mattson, and longtime collaborator Andrew Sowka. Influenced by the storytelling of John Prine and delivered with the delicacy of Simon & Garfunkel, their debut full-length, small town story, was produced by Jim Bryson (Kathleen Edwards, The Weakerthans) and nominated for both a 2024 Ontario Folk Music Award and a 2025 Canadian Folk Music Award. Their follow-up LP, Pine Trees In A Perfect Row, is set to be released August 28th, 2026. The NAC would like to acknowledge the generous support of John and Pina Sicard."
      },
      {
        "@value": "summersets est le nouveau projet de l’auteur-compositeur-interprète finaliste aux prix JUNO et Polaris Kalle Mattson, et de son collaborateur de longue date Andrew Sowka. Rappelant le talent de conteur de John Prine et la douceur intemporelle de Simon and Garfunkel, small town story, le premier album du duo produit par Jim Bryson (Kathleen Edwards, The Weakerthans), a été finaliste aux Prix de la musique folk de l’Ontario en 2024 et aux Prix de musique folk canadienne l’année suivante. Son deuxième album, Pine Trees In A Perfect Row, paraîtra le 28 août 2026. Le Centre national des Arts tient à souligner le généreux soutien de John et Pina Sicard."
      }
    ],
