      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Carole Pope and Kevan Staples’s band Rough Trade was inducted into Canada’s Walk of Fame in 2023. On the Polaris Prize short list, Carole Pope is an agent provocateur pushing the boundaries of sexuality, sexual politics, and the status quo. Her work has been recognised with three Juno Awards, multiple independent music awards, a Genie Award, four gold, one platinum, and one double platinum album. Her latest singles “I Miss My Land” and “Play Fisty For Me” are available everywhere...."
