        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-11-18T22:30:00-05:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The King James Bible Play Written by Charlotte Corbeil-Coleman"
      },
      {
        "@value": "The King James Bible Play Texte de Charlotte Corbeil-Coleman"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "All is not as it seems as a committee of religious scholars attempt to translate the Bible for King James I, navigating clashing egos, royal expectations, and – anachronistically – the nature of male loneliness."
      },
      {
        "@value": "Les apparences sont parfois trompeuses chez ce comité d’érudits religieux qui tente de traduire la Bible pour le roi Jacques Ier. Tout ce beau monde doit jongler avec les luttes d’ego, les attentes royales et (léger anachronisme) la nature de la solitude masculine."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@value": "Theatre"
      },
