  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/event/41637#2026-12-12T20:00:00-05:00",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/additionalType": [
      {
        "@id": "http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/MusicEvent"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-12-12T20:00:00-05:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-12-12T22:00:00-05:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Montreal Guitar Trio Christmas Around the World"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Montreal Guitar Trio Noël autour du monde"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Our three guitar virtuosos revisit holiday classics with boundless creativity, bold arrangements and a style all their own. On the program: Tchaikovsky’s spellbinding Nutcracker, the timeless warmth of Vince Guaraldi’s A Charlie Brown Christmas, and even more festive surprises! The Montréal Guitare Trio (MG3) electrifies, moves and captivates audiences, lighting up the stage. For over 25 years, this charismatic trio has shared their contagious energy with passion and intensity. But they’re more than just guitar players. These multi-instrumentalists let the violin, mandolin, bass, accordion and even their voices shine in this rich, dazzling performance."
      },
      {
        "@value": "Nos trois virtuoses de la guitare revisitent les incontournables de Noël avec une créativité débordante, des arrangements éclatés et un style totalement unique. Au programme : l’envoûtant Casse-Noisette de Tchaïkovski, la douceur intemporelle de A Charlie Brown Christmas de Vince Guaraldi… et bien d’autres surprises festives! Le Montréal Guitare Trio (MG3) électrise, bouleverse, captive et enflamme. Depuis plus de 25 ans, le trio au charisme renversant transmet son énergie contagieuse avec passion et intensité. Bien plus que des guitares : ces multi-instrumentistes font jaillir violon, mandoline, basse, accordéon et même leurs voix, pour un spectacle riche et flamboyant."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@value": "Francophone"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Music"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Canadian"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Holidays"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Musique"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Canadien"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Fêtes"
      }
    ],
