  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/event/40445#2027-04-08T20:00:00-04:00",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/additionalType": [
      {
        "@id": "http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/TheatrePerformance"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2027-04-08T20:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2027-04-08T21:30:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Pakuneu Intimate journey and search for meaning"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Pakuneu Traversée intime et quête de sens"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Pakuneu tells the story of a child born behind bars while her mother was serving time. Three paths lie before her: growing up in prison, being placed for adoption, or being raised by her grandmother. Despite a common starting point, the journeys diverge. Multidisciplinary artist Soleil Launière draws on Innu cosmology in this visceral and poetic creation, weaving together theatre, krump dance, song, and video to bring to life a work that is raw, powerful, and brimming with spirit."
      },
      {
        "@value": "Trois vies possibles, trois trajectoires intimes sont inventées à partir d’une même histoire : celle d’un·e enfant né·e en prison. Entre stigmatisation et résilience des lignées autochtones, Soleil Launière tisse ici une puissante tresse théâtrale où s’entrelacent d’impétueuses brindilles d’existences. Sur scène, un magnifique trio d’interprètes se partage cette poignante partition chorale."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@value": "Francophone"
