        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan Tour | Benefit for Ronald McDonald House Ottawa |  Sat, May 8, 2027, 7:30 pm | Babs Asper Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/41803/ticketmaster_nac_graphic_3840x2160_website__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "What started as an intimate comedy fundraiser has quickly become one of Ottawa's can't-miss comedy events.\n\nFollowing two consecutive sold-out editions in the National Arts Centre's Azrieli Studio, The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan returns for its 3rd annual benefit in support of Ronald McDonald House Ottawa—and this year, it's bigger than ever. Thanks to overwhelming demand, the event moves to the Babs Asper Theatre, welcoming nearly three times as many comedy fans for an unforgettable evening of laughter, community, and giving..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
    ]
