      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Yo-Yo Ma & John Storgårds | With the NAC Orchestra |  Tue, May 18, 2027, 8:00 pm | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/41806/yo_yo_ma_nac_orchestra_storgards__large.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Purchased tickets will be available in your NAC ticket account on May 3, 2027, two weeks before the concert.\n\n-----------\n\nA few things to know:\n\n\n\tGet ready for an evening of extraordinary artistry as the legendary Yo-Yo Ma takes to the stage with the NAC Orchestra for one night only. \n\tDvořák's Cello Concerto is one of the most beloved masterworks in the cello repertoire.\n\n\nFor more than 50 years, Yo-Yo Ma has introduced audiences around the world to the power of classical music, bringing warmth,..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
    ]
