        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2027-07-09T20:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2027-07-09T22:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "How to Train Your Dragon in Concert with the NAC Orchestra"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Dragons, ciné-concert avec l’Orchestre du CNA"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "When a young Viking defies tradition and befriends a ferocious dragon, together they must fight against all odds to save both their worlds. Experience this captivating film in HD, with its thrilling musical score performed live to picture!"
      },
      {
        "@value": "Un jeune Viking défie les traditions et devient ami avec un dragon féroce. Les deux compères devront lutter envers et contre tous pour sauver leurs mondes respectifs. Voyez ou revoyez ce film captivant en haute définition, accompagné de son excellente trame sonore interprétée en direct!"
      }
    ],
